🔵 DevOps

DevOps = Development + Operations

It is the process of taking normal software/code from development → testing → deployment → production and continuously maintaining it.

====

Example:
Developer writes code
        ↓
      GitHub
        ↓
   Build / Test
        ↓
      Docker
        ↓
      AWS
        ↓
   Production App
        ↓
Monitoring & Updates


===

Typical DevOps tools:
Git / GitHub
Docker
Jenkins / GitHub Actions
Kubernetes
AWS
Terraform
CloudWatch

=====




